    "5": "The Ark causes plagues and idol destruction in Philistine territory. Dagon falls before it, and the people suffer.",
    "6": "The Philistines return the Ark with offerings. It arrives in Beth-shemesh, but disrespect leads to more deaths.",
    "7": "Samuel leads Israel in repentance and victory over the Philistines. He judges Israel faithfully.",
